- name: note_overview
  id: note
  parameters:
    alias: ''
    comment: ''
    note: "OFDM VIDEO N321 2x2 MIMO LOOPBACK (t\u1ED5ng quan). M\u1ED9t N321 qua 10\
      \ GbE: TX/RX A:0,B:0 ph\xE1t, RX2 A:0,B:0 thu, 915 MHz, Fs 1 MS/s. [E1]-[E4]\
      \ l\xE0 Embedded Python g\u1ECDi class trong g\xF3i ofdm321 -> \u0111\u1EB7\
      t .grc trong OFDM_N321_MIMO/grc/ ho\u1EB7c export OFDM_N321_DIR. Ch\u01B0\u01A1\
      ng tr\xECnh ch\u1EA1y th\u1EADt l\xE0 run_n321.py (c\xF3 timed start, ki\u1EC3\
      m tra an to\xE0n RF, report.json); s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3\
      \ xem/th\u1EED nhanh."
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [8, 8]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
- name: note_rx
  id: note
  parameters:
    alias: ''
    comment: ''
    note: "RX: UHD source 2 k\xEAnh -> Schmidl-Cox g\u1ED9p 2 anten -> H 2x2 t\u1EEB\
      \ LTF -> SIG -> CPE pilot -> MRC|SFBC|MMSE -> RS -> CRC32 -> PDU -> RS8+8 ki\u1EC3\
      m ch\u1EE9ng -> TS + UDP 5002. SIM: disable 2 kh\u1ED1i UHD, enable [E4] channel,\
      \ n\u1ED1i E1->E4->E2, \u0111\u1EB7t throttle=True \u1EDF E1."
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [8, 620]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
- name: note_tx
  id: note
  parameters:
    alias: ''
    comment: ''
    note: "TX: TS -> DATA/RS8_PARITY/END (y h\u1EC7t N210) -> CRC32 -> RS(248,216)\
      \ -> scramble -> khung OFDM MIMO (STF+CSD, 2 LTF ma tr\u1EADn P, SIG CRC16,\
      \ payload + 4 pilot) -> 2 lu\u1ED3ng -> UHD sink 2 k\xEAnh. mimo_mode: siso|simo|alamouti|smux."
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [8, 300]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
